        "raw": "It&#39;s soon shipping day, so let&#39;s have some fun.&nbsp; :smiling_imp:  I don&#39;t know if it was ever already mentioned (I tried to search and found nothing).\n\nI recently re-read the flavor texts of the Time Cataclysm cards, and something hit me. In the flavor text for Tendrils of Madness, AZ calls Visionary &quot;Vanessa&quot;.\n\nIt&#39;s nothing special, really - but, when reading it, I thought it was strange for these two to use their first names, especially in a strange situation as this. Could it suggest that they are closer than it appears ? Probably not &quot;lovers&quot;, but at least very close friends ? There are other cards in the game where we see both of them together - suggesting that they sometimes &quot;work&quot; as a duo. I should browse them all again and make a list ( first to come to mind is the red dust card in Wagner where they both are, hum, dusting their costume).\n\nThey both are &quot;outcasts&quot;, in their own way : she is not of this time and reality, he is ridden with guilt.&nbsp; He can&#39;t survive without his suit, she is&nbsp; slowly dying. He can&#39;t control his power without his modules - she can control the powers of others ( reminds me of Jean Grey/Cyclops ). He feels guilty about his past - she risked everything to change hers...\n\nSo, at least they seem to be a good &quot;pair&quot; of heroes to team together - if not a secret couple  :wink:  My personal theory is that they feel comfortable near each other, and have a strong friendship, with shades of something more. They are not the romantic kind, so rather than dating, they do heroic things together.\n\nThe fact is that I&#39;d like to see comics about this two people team !\n\nAnyway - this little &quot;Vanessa&quot; thing obssessed me for days, I had to let it out  :slightly_smiling_face: ",
